   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"4\">Estimados,</font></div><div><br></div><div><font size=\"4\" color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">I am trying to use N-mixture model to estimate\r\nabundance of Black-faced Ibis in Antisana Volcano in Ecuador. We conducted\r\nsimultaneous survey with three visits in each site. I wonder if N-mixture model\r\nworks without covariables. I do not find how to run this in pcount. I would\r\nappreciate any input on this subject. </span><br></font></div><div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"4\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></div><div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"4\" color=\"#000000\">All the best,</font></span></div><div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"4\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></div><div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"4\" color=\"#000000\">Adrian</font></span></div><div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#0f243e\"><br></span></div><div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#0f243e\"><br></span></div><div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#0f243e\">--</span></div><div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#0f243e\"><div style=\"font-size:12.8px;direction:ltr;padding-bottom:5px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,128);font-size:10pt\"><div>Adrián Naveda-Rodríguez, MSc</div><div>E-mail: <a href style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">adrian...@gmail.com</a></div><div>Tel: 593 980 792 316 (Ecuador)</div><div><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Adrian_Naveda-Rodriguez\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Adrian_Naveda-Rodriguez&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792452538102000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2eyQnllt19j6gyqiTd-Vlu\">https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Adrian_Naveda-Rodriguez</a> </div><div> </div><div>Si no lo puedes explicar de forma sencilla, todavia no lo entiendes lo suficiente</div><div>If you cant&#39;t explain it simply, you don&#39;t understant it well enough</div><div>Albert Einstein</div><div><br></div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"clear:both;font-size:12.8px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif\"></div></span></div></div>"
    ]
