     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Verdana;color:#000000;font-size:10pt\">\r\n<font size=\"2\">Hola Adrian,<br>\r\n<br>\r\nhow many sites did you do your surveys at ? Over how long a period are the surveys at a site spread out ?<br>\r\n<br>\r\nSaludos  -- Marc<br>\r\n</font>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;font-size:16px\">\r\n<hr>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"><font face=\"Tahoma\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><b>From:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a> [<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a>] on behalf of Benedikt Schmidt [<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">benz.s...@gmx.ch</a>]<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> 16 April 2016 14:43<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Aw: [unmarked] N-mixture model without covariate<br>\r\n</font><br>\r\n</div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div><div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Verdana;color:#000000;font-size:10pt\"><div style=\"font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;font-size:16px\">\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Verdana;font-size:12.0px\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>Dear Adrian,</div>\r\n<div>Yes, you can fit a Nmixture model without covariates. You have to create an unmarked data frame for point count data without covariates. The model is then</div>\r\n<div>model = pcount(~1 ~1, your UMF)</div>\r\n<div>~1 means that you fit an intercept-only model.</div>\r\n<div>Best wishes, Benedikt</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div> \r\n<div name=\"quote\" style=\"margin:10px 5px 5px 10px;padding:10px 0 10px 10px;border-left:2px solid #c3d9e5;word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0\"><b>Gesendet:</b> Freitag, 15. April 2016 um 23:51 Uhr<br>\r\n<b>Von:</b> &quot;Adrian Naveda-Rodriguez&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">adrian...@gmail.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>An:</b> unmarked &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Betreff:</b> [unmarked] N-mixture model without covariate</div>\r\n<div name=\"quoted-content\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"4\">Estimados,</font></div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"4\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">I am trying to use N-mixture model to estimate abundance of Black-faced Ibis in Antisana Volcano in Ecuador. We conducted simultaneous survey with three visits in each site. I wonder\r\n if N-mixture model works without covariables. I do not find how to run this in pcount. I would appreciate any input on this subject. </span></font></div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"4\">All the best,</font></span></div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"4\">Adrian</font></span></div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(15,36,62)\">--</span></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:12.8px;direction:ltr;padding-bottom:5.0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif\">\r\n<div style=\"overflow:hidden\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_quote\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_quote\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,128);font-size:10.0pt\">\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(15,36,62)\">Adrián Naveda-Rodríguez, MSc</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(15,36,62)\">E-mail: <a href=\"http://UrlBlockedError.aspx\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://UrlBlockedError.aspx&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792452538110000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2D2TjsJCgJlmVvAWVN48EU\">adrian...@gmail.com</a></span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(15,36,62)\">Tel: 593 980 792 316 (Ecuador)</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(15,36,62)\"><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Adrian_Naveda-Rodriguez\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Adrian_Naveda-Rodriguez&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792452538110000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0lnJWz0KBT0gslUzZfMk14\">https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Adrian_Naveda-Rodriguez</a> </span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(15,36,62)\"> </span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(15,36,62)\">Si no lo puedes explicar de forma sencilla, todavia no lo entiendes lo suficiente</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial,sans-seri